sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant W as Web
  participant C as Cache
  participant D as Database
  U->>+W: GET /product/42
  W->>C: get product:42
  alt cache hit
    C-->>W: product
  else miss
    C-->>W: nil
    W->>+D: SELECT * FROM products
    D-->>-W: row
    W-)C: set product:42 (ttl 300)
  end
  Note over W,C: stale-while-revalidate after 240s
  W-->>-U: 200 OK
